  "releaseNotes": "Added WriteLineProgress and DebugProgress implementations of DebugProgress, for easily enabling progress from different unit test frameworks (for instance).\n      Added a couple of methods to peSHIr.IO.FileSystem for working with files and folders, containing more extensive bits of error handling that might come in handy on environments with network (storage) that might be more flaky or restricted security-wise than you would like.\n      Finally moved some code into peSHIr.Net that I needed to move forward with some restructuring at work.",
